The patch introduces a new variable `user_size` that captures the size specified by the user. It then checks if this `user_size` exceeds the maximum size allowed (`size`). If it does, the function returns an error code `-EMSGSIZE`, preventing the copy operation from attempting to exceed the user-specified size, thus fixing the bug. Additionally, the `copy_from_user` function is updated to use `user_size` instead of `size`, ensuring that only the correct amount of data is copied from userspace.

